{# Oct 15 2026: a guest named people for Mira to interview and she could not
   find a public address for them, or could not tell who was meant. One
   note to the guest, after their episode is out, asking for an
   introduction. Sent by pipelines/voices/referrals.py. #}
{% set people = referrals or [] %}
<div style="font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;color:#1a202c;line-height:1.6">
  <p>Hi {{ first_name or guest_name }},</p>
  <p>Thank you again for our conversation on {{ show_name }}. Your episode is here, if you'd
  like to share it: <a href="{{ episode_url }}" style="color:{{ brand_color }}">{{ episode_url }}</a></p>
  <p>When I asked who I should interview next, you named
  {% for r in people %}{% if not loop.first %}{{ ' and ' if loop.last else ', ' }}{% endif %}<strong>{{ r.name }}</strong>{% if r.organization %} ({{ r.organization }}){% endif %}{% endfor %}.
  I'd love to invite {{ people[0].first_name if people|length == 1 else 'them' }}, and an invitation
  that comes with your name on it means a great deal more than one from me alone.</p>
  <p>Would you be willing to introduce us? The easiest way is to reply with an email address,
  or to copy them on a reply to this email, and I'll
  take it from there.{% if unclear %} And if I've misheard a name, tell me who you meant.{% endif %}</p>
  <p>If you'd rather not, no problem at all.</p>
  {{ signature }}
</div>
